OL,3,GNEWSAThe Scouse actor reaching new
OL,4,Aheights in Liverpool drama This City Is
OL,5,AOurs
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith millions of viewers and a major
OL,8,Frole in a Bafta-nominated series, you
OL,9,Fmight not expect Adam Abbou to know
OL,10,Fmuch about feeling self-conscious.
OL,12,F"When we were kids it wasn't so cool to
OL,13,Fbe from Liverpool," the This City Is
OL,14,FOurs actor says.
OL,16,F"I'd be in these rooms with people who
OL,17,Fwere really posh and I always felt out
OL,18,Fof place."
